DARE is a song by English virtual band Gorillaz and is the second single from their second studio album, Demon Days (2005).

I have to give thanks to these people for taking the time to test play my map.  I appreciate you all so very much! 

@Tastum: For being the brain behind the bombs

@Monstor: For giving me the technical feedback to get this into decent shape

@Brownie thanks for giving it a go!

@Exa thanks for giving it a go!

Expert Plus was modded by @Alice and thank you for helping me fine tuning the lowers.  I appreciate you so much girly!

